```

Typing check: `listFor: (userId, options) => {...}` — contextually typed by SessionStore's listFor signature? The original had exactly this (line 106-109) with `seen.push({userId, options})` — so contextual typing worked (SessionStore.listFor's params). ✓ Return `[listedConversation.summary]` — SessionSummary[] ✓.

Let me check SessionStore.listFor signature to be safe.

